@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### ============================================================
### DAY 18 — COMMENT MODERATION
### ============================================================

### List Comments

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Pending Comments

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Approved Comments

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments?status=approved
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Comments

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments?search=John
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### View Comment

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Approve Comment

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Mark Spam

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments/1/spam
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Reject Comment

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Comment

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


##### Test here

### ============================================================
### DAY 18 — COMMENT STATISTICS
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/comments/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json